; The order and the ids of the budget errors. The fold reports an undefined budget, a closed budget and a duplicate as
; it meets them, in ledger order; the amounts no price converts are checked after the fold, once every price is
; known, so their BudgetCommodityMismatch errors come after the others, whatever their place. A budget-transfer in a
; commodity neither budget converts has two of them at one place, its `from` budget's first, then its `to` budget's,
; whatever their names; the second error of a kind at one place has an id of its own.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Zeta
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Ghost
  budget: Ghost

2024-01-01 budget Zeta CNY
2024-01-01 budget Alpha CNY

2024-01-02 budget-transfer Zeta Alpha 10 USD

2024-01-03 budget-add Ghost 1 CNY

2024-01-04 * "Shop" "USD, which no price converts"
  Expenses:Food 5 USD
  Expenses:Ghost 1 CNY
  Assets:Bank -5 USD
  Assets:Bank -1 CNY

2024-01-05 budget-close Zeta

2024-01-06 * "Shop" "after the close"
  Expenses:Food 1 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-07 budget Alpha USD
